<view class="earn-page">
 <view wx:if="{{rewardViewMode==='tasks'}}" class="earn-main">
  <view class="earn-stage"><view class="earn-stage-ring"></view><text>元享 · 每天都有新收获</text><view>今天的收获，<text>从这里开始。</text></view><text>每天一点金币，离喜欢更近一点。</text><image src="/sage_dksy/resource/red/coin.png" mode="aspectFit"/></view>
  <navigator class="earned-ticket" url="/sage_dksy/pages/user/integral"><view><text>我的金币</text><text>{{balance===null?'—':balance}}</text><text>金币</text></view><text>查看明细 ›</text></navigator>
  <yx-state wx:if="{{loading && !loaded}}" type="loading" title="正在获取可参与任务"/>
  <view wx:else class="earn-task-card"><view class="earn-task-top"><view class="earn-task-icon"><yx-icon name="play" tone="light" size="50"/></view><view><text>自愿看广告</text><text>完整观看后领取{{home.remaining!==null?' · 剩余 '+home.remaining+' 次':''}}</text></view><text class="earn-task-tag">{{home.status}}</text></view><view class="earn-task-bottom"><view><text>{{home.coins===null?'待同步':'+'+home.coins}}</text><text wx:if="{{home.coins!==null}}">金币</text></view><button class="ui-primary" bindtap="showOffer" disabled="{{loading || watching || home.state==='disabled' || home.state==='limit' || home.state==='pending'}}">{{home.state==='cool'?'查看冷却':(home.available?'去观看':'查看状态')}}</button></view></view>
  <view class="earn-check"><view><yx-icon name="check" tone="brand" size="50"/><view><text>{{signLoading?'正在同步签到':(signed?'今天已经签到':'今天还没签到')}}</text><text>连续签到，奖励提前看</text></view></view><button class="ui-secondary" bindtap="goSign">{{signed?'查看记录':(signReward===null?'去签到':'签到 +'+signReward)}}</button></view>
  <view class="benefit-pair"><navigator class="benefit-card benefit-read" url="/sage_dksy/pages/v12/list"><view class="benefit-card-top"><yx-icon name="book" tone="brand" size="42"/><text>阅读专区</text><yx-icon name="arrow" tone="brand" size="24"/></view><text class="benefit-title">阅读文章</text><text class="benefit-caption">免费阅读 · 自愿广告激励</text></navigator><navigator class="benefit-card benefit-growth" url="/sage_dksy/pages/growth/index"><view class="benefit-card-top"><yx-icon name="gift" tone="brand" size="42"/><text>成长礼遇</text><yx-icon name="arrow" tone="brand" size="24"/></view><text class="benefit-title">7天成长礼遇</text><text class="benefit-caption">查看进度 · 达标领取</text></navigator></view>
  <navigator class="invite-inline" url="/sage_dksy/pages/v11/promote"><yx-icon name="friend" tone="brand" size="48"/><view><text>一级推广 · 邀请好友</text><text>专属海报、一级好友与推广说明</text></view><yx-icon name="arrow" tone="muted" size="30"/></navigator>
  <navigator class="benefit-rules-link" url="/sage_dksy/pages/v14/rewards/index">奖励与活动说明 <yx-icon name="arrow" tone="muted" size="24"/></navigator>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="ui-error" bindtap="retry">{{error}} · 点击重试</view><view class="earn-notice"><yx-icon name="info" tone="brand" size="34"/><text>普通浏览无需观看广告；金币到账以实际记录为准。</text></view>
 </view>
 <view wx:elif="{{rewardViewMode==='offer'}}" class="reward-body">
  <view class="ad-prelude"><view class="ad-play-emblem"><yx-icon name="play" tone="light" size="80"/></view><text>自愿参与 · 广告奖励</text><view>看一段广告，<text>攒一点金币。</text></view></view>
  <view class="ad-offer-card"><text>本次可领取</text><view><text>{{home.coins===null?'待同步':'+'+home.coins}}</text><text wx:if="{{home.coins!==null}}">金币</text></view><view class="ad-offer-meta"><text>今日剩余</text><text>{{home.remaining===null?'待同步':home.remaining+' 次'}}</text></view></view>
  <view class="watch-rules ui-card"><view><yx-icon name="play" tone="brand" size="40"/><view><text>完整观看后领取</text><text>提前关闭，本次不发放奖励</text></view></view><view><yx-icon name="shield" tone="brand" size="40"/><view><text>到账以服务端核验为准</text><text>可在金币明细查看结果</text></view></view><view><yx-icon name="clock" tone="brand" size="40"/><view><text>按实际状态参与</text><text>{{home.hint}}</text></view></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{!home.available}}" class="reward-status-note"><text>{{home.status}}</text><button class="ui-text-button" bindtap="retryReward">重新获取状态</button></view><button class="ui-text-button" bindtap="closeRewardView">返回赚金币</button>
 </view>
 <view wx:elif="{{rewardViewMode==='paid'}}" class="reward-body paid-view"><view class="reward-status-mark"><yx-icon name="yes" tone="brand" size="78"/></view><text class="paid-tag">完整观看 · 结算成功</text><view class="reward-result-title">本次奖励已到账</view><view class="prize-ticket"><text>本次获得金币</text><view class="ticket-amount">+{{rewardCoins}}<text>金币</text></view><view class="ticket-divider"></view><view class="ticket-row"><text>当前金币</text><text>{{balance===null?'正在同步':balance}}</text></view><view class="ticket-row"><text>任务类型</text><text>广告奖励</text></view></view><view class="earn-notice"><yx-icon name="clock" tone="brand" size="34"/><text>下一次参与时间按当前状态显示，奖励可在明细核对。</text></view><navigator class="reward-next" url="/sage_dksy/pages/prize/index" open-type="redirect"><yx-icon name="gift" tone="brand" size="50"/><view><text>离喜欢的好礼，又近一点。</text><text>去看看金币可以兑换什么</text></view><yx-icon name="arrow" tone="muted" size="30"/></navigator></view>
 <view wx:elif="{{rewardViewMode==='cool'}}" class="reward-body cool-view"><text class="ui-kicker">自愿广告奖励</text><view class="cool-title">歇一会，<text>下一份奖励稍后再来。</text></view><view class="cool-ring"><text>本轮冷却剩余</text><text>{{home.state==='cool'?home.button:'状态待刷新'}}</text><text>时间结束后，将重新确认任务状态</text></view><view class="cool-task ui-card"><view><yx-icon name="play" tone="brand" size="46"/><view><text>看广告赚金币</text><text>完整观看后按当前规则领取</text></view><text>{{home.remaining===null?'待同步':'剩余 '+home.remaining+' 次'}}</text></view><button class="ui-secondary" disabled="{{home.state==='cool'}}" bindtap="retryReward">{{home.state==='cool'?'冷却中 · 暂不可观看':'重新查看状态'}}</button></view><view class="cool-next-title">这段时间，也可以</view><navigator class="reward-next" url="/sage_dksy/pages/prize/index" open-type="redirect"><yx-icon name="gift" tone="brand" size="48"/><view><text>看看心仪的好礼</text><text>按自己的节奏慢慢攒</text></view><yx-icon name="arrow" tone="muted" size="30"/></navigator><view class="reward-next" bindtap="goLedger"><yx-icon name="coin" tone="brand" size="48"/><view><text>核对金币明细</text><text>每笔到账都有记录</text></view><yx-icon name="arrow" tone="muted" size="30"/></view></view>
 <view wx:else class="reward-body interrupted-view"><view class="interrupted-emblem"><yx-icon name="{{rewardViewMode==='unpaid'?'play':rewardViewMode==='pending'?'clock':'info'}}" tone="muted" size="80"/></view><view class="reward-result-title">{{rewardViewMode==='unpaid'?'这次还没有获得奖励':rewardViewMode==='pending'?'本次奖励仍在处理中':'广告暂时不可用'}}</view><text class="reward-result-sub">{{rewardViewMode==='unpaid'?'广告未完整观看，\n本次不会发放金币':rewardViewMode==='pending'?'请稍后核对金币明细，\n当前不显示到账金额':'请稍后重新获取任务状态，\n普通浏览不受影响'}}</text><view class="interrupted-card ui-card"><view><text>本次奖励</text><text>{{rewardViewMode==='unpaid'?'未发放':rewardViewMode==='pending'?'处理中':'未确认'}}</text></view><view><text>我的金币</text><text>{{balance===null?'正在同步':balance+' 金币'}}</text></view></view><view class="earn-notice"><yx-icon name="info" tone="brand" size="34"/><text>你可以返回赚金币重新查看可参与状态，也可以继续浏览好礼。</text></view><button class="ui-primary" bindtap="closeRewardView">返回赚金币</button><button class="ui-secondary result-gift-button" bindtap="goGifts">去看看好礼</button></view>
 <view wx:if="{{rewardViewMode==='offer' || rewardViewMode==='paid' || rewardViewMode==='cool'}}" class="reward-footer-spacer"></view><view wx:if="{{rewardViewMode==='offer' || rewardViewMode==='paid' || rewardViewMode==='cool'}}" class="reward-footer"><button wx:if="{{rewardViewMode==='offer'}}" class="ui-primary" disabled="{{!home.available || watching || loading}}" loading="{{watching}}" bindtap="watchHome">{{watching?'奖励处理中':(home.available?(home.coins===null?'自愿完整观看':'自愿观看，完成领 '+home.coins+' 金币'):home.button)}}</button><button wx:elif="{{rewardViewMode==='paid'}}" class="ui-primary" bindtap="goLedger">查看金币明细</button><button wx:else class="ui-secondary" bindtap="closeRewardView">返回赚金币</button></view>
 <include wx:if="{{rewardViewMode==='tasks'}}" src="/sage_dksy/pages/nav/nav.wxml"/>
</view>
